[00:00.00][by:刀丛寻诗]
[01:03.80]From morning to night I stayed out of sight
[01:03.80]从早到晚呆在看不见的地方
[01:12.40]Didn't recognise I'd become
[01:12.40]不能接受现在的样子
[01:19.20]No more than alive I'd barely survive
[01:19.20]勉强存在的苟活
[01:27.49]In a word...overrun
[01:27.49]反正行将崩溃
[01:33.56]
[01:34.30]Won't hear a sound
[01:34.30]听不到一点声音
[01:38.53]From my mouth
[01:38.53]从我的嘴里发出
[01:42.16]I've spent too long
[01:42.16]我浪费太多时间
[01:46.03]On the inside out
[01:46.03]把内心抛弃
[01:49.68]My skin is cold
[01:49.68]我的身体冰冷
[01:53.85]To the human touch
[01:53.85]同类的触碰
[01:57.76]This bleeding heart's
[01:57.76]悲伤的心
[02:01.70]Not beating much
[02:01.70]没有更多悸动
[02:05.33]
[02:06.38]I murmured a vow of silence and now
[02:06.38]喃语一个沉默的誓言
[02:14.76]I don't even hear when I think aloud
[02:14.76]甚至不能听到自艾的自言自语
[02:21.68]Extinguished by light I turn on the night
[02:21.68]熄灭照亮我黑夜的灯
[02:30.61]Wear its darkness with an empty smile
[02:30.61]在黑暗里独自带着空洞的笑
[02:50.43]
[02:54.53]I'm creeping back to life
[02:54.53]我正匍匐爬回生活
[02:57.65]My nervous system all awry
[02:57.65]我的神经全都扭结
[03:02.64]I'm wearing the inside out
[03:02.64]我的灵魂暴露在外
[03:34.20]
[03:41.05]Look at him now
[03:41.05]现在看看他
[03:44.46]He's paler somehow
[03:44.46]莫名奇妙的苍白
[03:51.18]But he's coming around
[03:51.18]但他开始苏醒
[03:56.28]He's starting to choke
[03:56.28]他正开始抑制那些感觉
[03:59.20]It's been so long since he spoke
[03:59.20]过了很久他开口
[04:04.85]Well he can have the words right from my mouth
[04:04.85]借我的口他言语
[04:10.95]And with these words I can see
[04:10.95]在这些词句中我明晰
[04:11.16]
[04:18.74]Clear through the clouds that covered me
[04:18.74]穿过覆盖我的云层
[04:26.67]Just give it time then speak my name
[04:26.67]给它说出我名字的时间
[04:34.61]Now we can hear ourselves again
[04:34.61]现在我们可以再次认识自己
[04:42.69]
[04:43.43]I'm holding out
[04:43.43]我还在坚持
[04:46.55]For the day
[04:46.55]为了那一天
[04:50.34]When all the clouds
[04:50.34]所有乌云
[04:54.07]Have blown away
[04:54.07]消逝散尽
[04:57.81]I'm with you now
[04:57.81]现在我和你在一起
[05:02.07]Can speak your name
[05:02.07]可以叫出你的名字
[05:06.10]Now we can hear
[05:06.10]现在我们可以
[05:09.69]Ourselves again
[05:09.69]再次认识自己
